<title>MEXICO: Penoles outlines 6 mo mining content.</title>
<headline>Penoles outlines 6 mo mining content.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrias Penoles, the world's largest refined silver producer, detailed on Tuesday metal content volumes produced by the company's mining division in the first half of 1997.</p>
<p>Gold in kilograms, silver and base metals in tonnes.</p>
<p>    Metal		H1 1997	  H1 1996</p>
<p>    Gold		   2,530	    2,071</p>
<p>    Silver		   566.5	    489.1</p>
<p>    Lead		  34,867	   35,323</p>
<p>    Zinc		  64,571	   60,396</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
</text>
